{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e8f0d6006945d280ad99","chatId":"d8a7af370cc549d79c5a6c79c41beffd","sessionId":null,"userId":69472,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"C\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"C\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":806,"promptTokens":1477,"completionTokens":20,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:02:56"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.005218223538879356,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e8f0d6006945d280ad98","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369776308,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:02:56","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e8f0d6006945d280ad98","chatId":"d8a7af370cc549d79c5a6c79c41beffd","sessionId":null,"userId":69472,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n由于恐夜症，莫莉一直害怕黑暗。她避开所有没有光的地方和活动，以感到轻松。今天晚上，莫利和她的同学被分配了一个天文学项目，要求他们在下午观察撒哈拉沙漠的星星。\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，莫莉最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 紧张\nB) 害怕\nC) 激动\nD) 无感\nE) 感激\nF) 惊喜\n\n## 问题 2\n莫莉为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 她怕黑，但下午的撒哈拉沙漠光线很好\nB) 她对天文学项目有浓厚的兴趣\nC) 她害怕在撒哈拉的下午时分待在户外\nD) 她不喜欢和她的同学一起进行小组工作。","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.005218223538879356,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e8f0d6006945d280ad99","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369776305,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:02:56","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"23d412782b0a434ab254df43cd3b4a58"}